    "problem_statement": "The adi,tmc2209 stepper driver's microstep resolution control pins are described by a single combined 'msx-gpios' phandle-array property, whereas the other step/dir stepper drivers describe them as two separate 'm0-gpios' and 'm1-gpios' properties. A device node that configures the driver using 'm0-gpios'/'m1-gpios' must be accepted, and stepper_set_micro_step_res() must drive the M0 and M1 GPIO outputs to the values corresponding to the requested microstep resolution (and report that resolution back via stepper_get_micro_step_res()).",
